COAT-Learn (coatlearn)
Copyright 2026 COAT-Learn contributors

COAT authors: Chenxi Liu, Yongqiang Chen, Tongliang Liu, Mingming Gong,
James Cheng, Bo Han and Kun Zhang.

This software implements the authors' COAT research framework. The
publication organizes the maintained research implementation into functional
modules and renames the Python package and command to coatlearn. Source
provenance and the scope of these changes are recorded in SOURCE_MAP.md.

